  "text": "## Risk Assessment Framework  \n### Risk Identification  \n**Continuous Process:**\n- Annual risk assessment (by department)\n- Process walk-throughs with management\n- Incident trend analysis\n- Regulatory change assessment\n- External threat monitoring  \n**Risk Register:**\n- Centralized log of identified risks\n- Risk ID, description, impact, likelihood\n- Current and residual risk rating\n- Responsible party",
